From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: milkflint <milkflint@localhost>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:05:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] milkflint compat: drop NL80211_IFTYPE_NAN_DATA cases for
 OpenWrt 25.12 mac80211

mac80211/nl80211 from Linux 6.18 (OpenWrt 25.12 backports) has no
NL80211_IFTYPE_NAN_DATA. It is only used for mt7925 NAN data paths,
which an MT7986 access point never creates. Not for upstream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 mt76_connac_mcu.c | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mt76_connac_mcu.c b/mt76_connac_mcu.c
index 3e134f71..2339ef38 100644
--- a/mt76_connac_mcu.c
+++ b/mt76_connac_mcu.c
@@ -466,7 +466,6 @@ void mt76_connac_mcu_sta_basic_tlv(struct mt76_dev *dev, struct sk_buff *skb,
 		basic->aid = cpu_to_le16(link_sta->sta->aid);
 		break;
 	case NL80211_IFTYPE_NAN:
-	case NL80211_IFTYPE_NAN_DATA:
 		basic->conn_type = cpu_to_le32(CONNECTION_NAN);
 		break;
 	default:
@@ -1265,7 +1264,6 @@ int mt76_connac_mcu_uni_add_dev(struct mt76_phy *phy,
 		basic_req.basic.conn_type = cpu_to_le32(CONNECTION_IBSS_ADHOC);
 		break;
 	case NL80211_IFTYPE_NAN:
-	case NL80211_IFTYPE_NAN_DATA:
 		basic_req.basic.conn_type = cpu_to_le32(CONNECTION_NAN);
 		basic_req.basic.conn_state = !enable;
 		break;
@@ -1680,7 +1678,6 @@ int mt76_connac_mcu_uni_add_bss(struct mt76_phy *phy,
 		basic_req.basic.conn_type = cpu_to_le32(CONNECTION_IBSS_ADHOC);
 		break;
 	case NL80211_IFTYPE_NAN:
-	case NL80211_IFTYPE_NAN_DATA:
 		basic_req.basic.conn_type = cpu_to_le32(CONNECTION_NAN);
 		basic_req.basic.active = enable;
 		break;
